From: LinearMC <linearmc@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] LinearMC: src/main/java/org/bukkit/craftbukkit/entity/CraftPlayer.java

Coupled save (2026-11-26, same hunks as Folia minecraft-0020 / paper-0013): see net.linear.save.CoupledSave.
---
diff --git a/src/main/java/org/bukkit/craftbukkit/entity/CraftPlayer.java b/src/main/java/org/bukkit/craftbukkit/entity/CraftPlayer.java
--- a/src/main/java/org/bukkit/craftbukkit/entity/CraftPlayer.java
+++ b/src/main/java/org/bukkit/craftbukkit/entity/CraftPlayer.java
@@ -1391,7 +1391,7 @@ public class CraftPlayer extends CraftHumanEntity implements Player, PluginMessa
     @Override
     public void saveData() {
         ca.spottedleaf.moonrise.common.util.TickThread.ensureTickThread(this.entity, "Cannot save data async"); // Canvas - region guards
-        this.server.getHandle().playerIo.save(this.getHandle());
+        io.papermc.paper.linear.LinearCoupledSave.save(this.server.getServer(), this.getHandle(), () -> this.server.getHandle().playerIo.save(this.getHandle())); // Linear - coupled save: follows the region's chunks
     }
 
     @Deprecated
